title: "SITC public verification and reference package"
type: dataset
version: "1.0-rc2"
authors:
  - family-names: "Bankuti"
    given-names: "Omri"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-0246-7563"
identifiers:
  - type: other
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.22863692"
    description: "Reserved Zenodo DOI; not registered or published at package preparation."
abstract: >-
  A pre-publication public verification and reference package for an engineered
  finite causal assay. In the registered finite construction, a relationally
  self-indexed temporal state causally influenced future-directed choice
  through the separately intervened prospective-evaluation path. The package
  validates an explicit deterministic reference construction and evidence
  discipline; it does not establish consciousness, personhood, AGI,
  human-equivalent selfhood, spontaneous self-model emergence, or architectural
  novelty. Novelty is unadjudicated.
keywords:
  - "causal assay"
  - "engineered finite reference construction"
  - "relational self-indexing"
  - "self/other attribution"
  - "interchange intervention"
  - "causal ablation"
  - "prospective evaluation"
  - "checkpoint restoration"
  - "deterministic reproducibility"
